  "body": "# [4.47.0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/compare/v4.46.0...v4.47.0) (2026-11-09)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **catalog:** preserve canonical SDK authority in qualification controls ([e6a59fa](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/e6a59fa223ea22b61ad16399458f17b7da652af2))\n* **catalog:** record the Platform EventStore host consumer view ([#180](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/issues/180)) ([829e55a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/829e55a1b685908efbdc2756500b148007aae68f))\n* **ci:** isolate manual runs and harden submodule discovery ([9b9e03f](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/9b9e03f69b77e4a8e64e4185a1df1cb4bc315ba4))\n* **release:** retry transient GitHub notes pushes ([8039932](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/8039932ca0cbd00cff5944d4c456ebfe13e4743b))\n* **release:** support sanitized Git child processes ([32d2a06](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/32d2a0685663b5b47115b2c0972e4819c9a36b70))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **ci:** run environment hooks and integration tests ([78682df](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/78682df11bb4491c5995d0f5bc2626993ff7674b))\n"
